    },
    {
      "text": "Blood beasts are a type of path beast: they do not reproduce normally, but are born from heaven and earth using natural blood path dao marks. Soul beasts are named in the same group as snow monsters, mud monsters, cloud beasts, year beasts, and rock dragons.",
